set ::almanac::ASSET_artifacts_css {
/* =============================================================================
   artifacts.css @@U+2014@@ shared HTML design layer for field routes, diagrams,
   full routes, and the web-first tasks.toml board (wbpl).

   Materials: Harmonic16 Light neutrals with a fixed OKLCH desat/contrast pass
     for paper UI (source shed.tcl color1@@U+2013@@16 kept as reference comments).
     Functional azure is shed-anchored quieter tiers @@U+2014@@ not bright DL2 azure.
     Accent/selection #bf568b; shed raw categorical seeds (--shed-*) unchanged.
   Face: IBM Plex @@U+2014@@ runtime woff2 under assets/fonts/web/ (copied from
     system/deps/fonts/ibm-plex complete/woff2; sync-plex-web.sh). No CDN.
     No /usr/share runtime. IosevkaTerm stays terminal tools (not loaded here).
   Law: Design Language II discipline (system/plans/av/explainer-workflow/
     260822-003 + 260822-005) @@U+2014@@ categorical max 3 (violet/green/amber),
     azure functional only, tier jobs 700 ink / 500 fill / 200 area,
     type roles, unit snap. Light-only layer (no prefers-color-scheme flip).

   Canonical filename: artifacts.css. Bake also loads artifact.css (symlink).
   ============================================================================= */

@font-face {
