/* Field tags + plot parcel count: muted labels, not link chips. Tags are a
   row's own labels, never destinations; the plot index shows a count, never
   member parcel ids. Typed edges ref/up/cite are the only id links
   (.tag-link.edge-link). Identity (exactly one plot id) sits in .card-corner. */
.tag-meta--label {
  background: transparent;
