/* Metadata pills visibility @@U+2014@@ application toggle (both viewports).
   Cross-link pills (.tag-link) stay; they share the tag-meta box.
   Plot tags, parent plot id, and the parcel count are .tag-meta
   (not .tag-link), so metadata off hides them. No extra row. */
body.meta-hidden .card-tags .tag-meta:not(.tag-link),
